@startuml DFD

autonumber

actor "User" as user
participant "React" as front

box "System" #LightBlue
participant "Nginx" as balanser
participant "Backend" as api
database "Postgres" as db
end box

user -> front: тыкает кнопку
front -> balanser++: отправляем Post
balanser -> api++: валидированный и авторизованный Post
api -> db: Сохраняем лог
api -> balanser--: 200 Ok
balanser -> front--: Плашка "Запрос отправлен"


@enduml